1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,960
Protein lene se pehle box ki photo nahi, label padho!

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,290
Sirf 4 cheezein check karni hain.

3
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:11,440
Pehle serving size. Ek scoop kitne gram ka hai?

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,660
Saare numbers isi scoop ke hisaab se likhe hote hain.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:20,710
Dono mein 24 gram protein hai, par ek ka scoop bada hai.

6
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:25,190
Protein ko scoop size se divide karo. Jitni zyada percentage, utna better.

7
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,890
Achhi whey mein lagbhag 70–80% protein hota hai.

8
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,930
Teesra, added sugar.

9
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:38,520
Agar fat loss ya lean muscle goal hai, toh added sugar kam hona chahiye.

10
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,870
Ingredients mein jo pehle likha hai, woh sabse zyada hai.

11
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:47,470
Aur agar extra amino acids add kiye hain, toh protein number sach mein kam ho sakta hai.

12
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:51,540
Aur hamesha FSSAI number, batch aur expiry check karo.

13
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,030
Comment karo LABEL, main checklist bhej dunga.

14
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:59,120
Nutrition Hub Khanna. Genuine supplements, sahi guidance.
